    description: "DEEP bakeoff (8 cohorts, 48 repos) found that symbol ranking conflates architectural importance with call frequency. Examples: assert() ranked 6th in automerge, Button ranked above JobQueue.add in AFFiNE, logPanicAndDie dominates firecracker. The ranking dampening pipeline (PR #2129) handles test fixtures but not general utility/UI-primitive inflation. Consider: PageRank-style centrality, betweenness centrality, or edge-type weighting (renders_component vs calls)."  # b82e
